# Internal build-process documents for multi-loopr's own construction (via loopr) -- not part of
# the shipped tool. Untracked going forward; still present in earlier commit history. Anchored to
# repo root (a leading /) so this never shadows a same-named file legitimately shipped elsewhere in
# the tree, e.g. an examples/** fixture's own PHASE_1_SPEC.md.
/PHASE_*_SPEC.md
/multi-loopr-PRD.md
/COMPREHENSION.md
